  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>d</mi></math> are in G.P.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></math><br />Also, given that the sum of the terms is <math><mn>93</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>93</mn></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>93</mn></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>93</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>31</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>93</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> the terms are <math><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>75</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>&nbsp;the fourth term of the GP.. is <math><mn>75</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>375</mn></math>",
